# Optional convenience for development.
#
# Omakei normally learns its folder when you attach one in the editor, and
# remembers it in ~/.local/state/omakei/state.json. Setting this seeds that
# same state on first run so a fresh checkout starts with a folder attached.
#
# NOTE: this must be exported in your environment, not read from this file.
# Vite does not load .env files into process.env, and the ledger API plugin
# never calls loadEnv, so a value set only here never reaches the server:
#
#   OMAKEI_STATEMENTS_DIR=/absolute/path/to/statements npm run dev
#
# Never put real statements in the git repo.
